      "writtenOn": "2026-05-28T15:54:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that it is yucky, but the insetting is also required for `prepare_*_for_drawing`. It should really be a virtual function, like `glyphSrcPadding()` but there is no instance of the SubRun when calling `prepare_*_for_drawing`, hence the awkwardness.",
